  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0e51a20992694ca1841ad2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这一年过得挺快啊……也不赖吧。\r\n只有这样，才能把每一天都过得\r\n稍微刺激一些。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76c117f66787940cbd373c37883be1d96e0878ba09922ab4b14d52a302d26ba1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:032f48b5141e1977d4577152",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞，你今天过生日对吧。\r\n来想个能让你尽情感到“我还活着”\r\n的刺激赌局吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4b3bafe381d7452d4c6ca0760f8e4ce0026da30403801e7c4ac4e006a7a8071",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b43edd63e1d7a70549b32787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闯过无数个如冰冷的火焰般的\r\n生死关头才终于迎来这一天啊……\r\n不管怎么说，先祝你生日快乐吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ebf2538a7e062ee306e50d4498b91a31b04be3fefe0d9a68fea97ff16b001b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:007f52fa853a51d913be2cf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我家的那群小鬼每年都比我还兴奋。\r\n至少让我悠哉地度过自己的生日吧\r\n……真是的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e1ba4b40f501b971239796efc2e158afd7435b06595b1c58d4e5be221b176f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dd1b0280fcaaff28fe4f239",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然庆祝生日一般不吃那玩意儿……\r\n但我知道有家店的牛肚煮做得很棒。\r\n待会儿请我吃一碗如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "438e774d8cd7c9300e9d69cec7c026652123b7d2447383e5e0da43420fe3e46c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75186a8756d526cb586235c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有给你的通知哦。\r\n不去看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "660a873cdbb9c8e0a76d44295c1db1414a6ef329a6b7474123b42bb17dbcc2fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4da63be77d84498030aa87e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有送给你的礼物啊。\r\n……去瞧瞧里面是什么罢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42603d8fc8548331c000b111a29ef199f1a13a2effee675b2a1a996d8d8a9c7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:759d21c14331b1eee8f82a8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成吗……亲手赢来的奖品\r\n还是快点拿走比较好哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab7856a52d2cd5b02608dc41a83890c234b8df21ac47caa00a79d3dd94896e53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e627a4f597832fe410b8bc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像活动快开始了。\r\n那么……你也想去掺一脚吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7711510f25327e3ae0d232cee80050e6e3f4b63144ed519f048ec5c845aea76a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ac2ce79fec93f3dd8d1536b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在举办活动啊。\r\n……事情的进展都在你意料之中吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a12d6f938ddf5751bf4e60cbf6f9e8116676d3466a251fc99127d217e69ef7af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4943860922d96636e87552ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与胜利失之交臂啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae5a3ce3c949a6e56c1515b55f94576115073f24cb411eebe8df7d761faf0e23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b7334daa49cf4c099b89793",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴的等级好像上升了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23f4710cceadbae9e2e47839bbceee1fb52fb9c73dff4edb8e37f447d22a12e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf52a2e0f1c55233675cb8ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一緒にそれなりの修羅場を\r\n乗り越えてきた服だ。少しばかり\r\nくたびれ気味かもしれねえな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9880481146927bf561ccac6388ad3834edf39c29ed42f0addcd052847652a38f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f81e676a857bfab6ddfe809b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この格好で、いろんな“遊び”を\r\nしてきた。賛辞に罵声に敵意に…\r\n染みついてるもんもいろいろだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0e623e0befbb795aea2291fc122ae892c7688815a6535f1a2e33297252124d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c8f1d66cc60547ab3fd6f6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…服にネコの毛がついてるな。\r\nアイツら、1度懐くと\r\nまるで遠慮がねえんだよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "069b34d23c80b2644b993bf8a963923a6775db26165e84302306361c27cc6a74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b80f75ca55050ebc402d5c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和局……吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9c1126c1d13078bb710678d2f36eabc6db63aa1b32ad6178248339026edb25f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae969dcf5f777cd8cca8e8a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可是最棒的成果啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4975c3f29557832c986851af53ba5abed3403c8f540ebccc7476e5ca2c6ffc65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f42fb9e4d249b4ae399a144",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与胜利失之交臂啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae5a3ce3c949a6e56c1515b55f94576115073f24cb411eebe8df7d761faf0e23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15aa258b9c4ef61a74573176",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和局……吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9c1126c1d13078bb710678d2f36eabc6db63aa1b32ad6178248339026edb25f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edf982270d00c0a4569dfd5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迈向全新的领域了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff361f2521b4a71fab0c4e0ab45f5e122e72ca0509b89bfc724183fdcba26e6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8fcc5b656a881e3ab9f9aba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "令人寒毛卓竖的时间开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94aecec8a0a078ab8c0f5a8bbcc4f9e9f952641d53993f2123894fb50ec49282",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d65d480ef101d03b456e16c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2709448458e73ff6b70cb7b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练吗。\r\n一想到这是为真正的对决做准备，\r\n心跳就停不下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5574c6f1e906145787b00dad79fa7d95e6d2a6dba9e1663891e042ccd82ed3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec32ddba33a393bc36fa52e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔回首一下过去也不错啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c30be6df09f8a102a890087a3b05b29f52edd8cda1ab02ba01ba3822327bd144",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85ceee06af1d2b6b6b188363",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要比赛吗？行啊。\r\n是时候往心里添把柴火了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b2359b76add8c1c67eceae1fdd4c6df9c17a82d9d840abef5e5b83e20daaba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6e41a7c8d86a27a5cb881a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来一决胜负吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9253cc16c657e7458817a6d9653565ba1f08e9a7250ecc2dae212e253e96b6b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9da2c08b5a8d60126e077a7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上场比个输赢吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a0a9185a3ff09c636756e389f9b7ec512770e6605c9af035c67f2ec03337fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce64bfdc890d9c24995d9938",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "算我一份。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc855a34a0b0769052cb540164b8479ee096fcfd8430274ef86d99686e4b7f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1176"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c95c947f8f40be4434ca17e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a82f17f32130fdc2991cc9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热血沸腾……\r\n我的灵魂正在狂喜欢呼啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfcd3c82cc2b77a26289400262edd4ffa8c8bfb80335d381c4c210faba851922",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdeb6db0d45558cc5b3d25f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヒリつくねぇ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f18e67e52d5ec35a725cf3241c2d67f07eb32681c38e215f0e81e7c3756ac04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ed79db432eaeca8733f0bf8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc7b99b32d8f34da6bd620973df2ae9a0a57751a69db6f6dffcae6088fc7c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f92f4765fa15cc14f08e74d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可要好好享受一番啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "390c8ccffd6f616e09215f630a748530483f4a3e8ebf955c58bf9124771dfafa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3b57af7a5ecad85f04a5234",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不赖啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b9ab5b12f8adb5bd179042e899fa70b3417cff8dba86347558036a141720234",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8308362637a8e5b14862fa5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让它跑掉了吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a09f2df07b515a7f345884baa06a5d51c74210f0ea3eacc26b3ec0aedf6e3289",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feac3d010ef2f738b79f6f8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可真是让人吃惊啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "175ff1af5e84416864ce735ccce3498b1d6711587a525f5886765f8b3384b49b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33914af4bdf929b1ea3255aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拿下这局游戏了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3901d246e4f2e114b3ddc9968a45df7feeb637dc1ce159b4591d0e1841beac6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5808a48d4488cddf0d68e676",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛……偶尔也是会有这种日子啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d66d74ad7c79d96b0a1b3e3a9eb4423e0204817514ff4da9a73136c9ff1dfa77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05788e466e303e74e542bfc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可真是让人吃惊啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "175ff1af5e84416864ce735ccce3498b1d6711587a525f5886765f8b3384b49b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:319d1e645e3ccfb26bd15386",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拿下这局游戏了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3901d246e4f2e114b3ddc9968a45df7feeb637dc1ce159b4591d0e1841beac6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
