    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25da197e3df2924480f7e7fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这家伙溜走了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "385565f3f961d3bc10373990a24ff6ef11e2dbffffd83e61bfdac20a2e39aff2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20dd40e1c62a81393a3e08e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f943444c750c85eaa51e1654",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b931cbbc5ff834d619d16792036706cc06f14cf1a2024230235d3263006af89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55ecef08d151f6eb26f6ca7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦呀哦呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9893fd3ca0e2dc7551ccdda49f494e2d5d11626adba8783444f505328efb64fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7feb6a02b90aa2bd85df4bcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遗憾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3978ec435af4bcfb478104ee3d5c944c6b0d566771c30139dba8100cd378a55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92ef96ca7cc25a55d97210a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天应该是能拿到这个吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc6304ab2ab19a644f928242323221ecc6b463246e311294afde6763330a618a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7aafd427efdf23b9492ba9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……看来已经九死一生啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d6a30f1a309125f3de91be4f609ff076b533ce0faffd46be1bb3d05f6dd842a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c6f510a4fdf5670d8dfeb8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说实话，身体已经到极限了……\r\n……要向死而生地赌一把吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9830ecf9b1dedfd8b11755c562cc468373ac49283903473f65587fca465b2fe1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:411e98fa01bb9bf7da83649b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人总有激情上头所以根本无法停下来\r\n的时候……你懂吗？\r\n现在就是放手一搏之时……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "120afd8d3023f4930215d24be84b3546d0ea656f913e4e0cbdc886f9ca383798",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:942809343acecc1b41328a91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿，我也真服了……\r\n这股激情不到真正的对决之时\r\n可无法平息啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c8a89e684cd1e88fc6b72b89af10235829fc32b4982a8e9f4b414059a7a6b73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe2f6bef2da24eb3045f2f69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态不错。\r\n来，说说看有什么计划吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac9ea4ac8f159e7b523050f1becbfad06e9b232c4c443f20d02f3a599307b1aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c7b8ca24ac6635fc6b04499",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉现在手气不错……\r\n来吧，赶紧开始下一步吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99743cc101a66fce8f56d809f107a71a0b13455272319313a5064ed1529994ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e8c306425d25c6d80263d8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "算不上好也算不上坏……\r\n不足倒也都补上了，一步一步来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9c4aa041b1b6df4bc663ff762bbd5dbbe947f2c4e6baa782299c977e1ae7c05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be4319132de69e27e4f2466",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "究竟会顺风而行还是逆风拼搏呢……\r\n接下来可就全看我们自己啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f552896a8e0d7d4b09ea648cf1ac5c4d04891853bfcc2ee1cdc2139286bf8ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a389c86cbf9329f22c70adae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然感觉现在运气不行……\r\n但我也不是处在能悠哉混日子\r\n的立场上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91ec027619385613c1f6e292610b3866b0daf44e49ab70e5e814ee2ac4942a1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:781a25388e14e5d18f6dabe3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天好像老天爷不赏脸啊。\r\n可别太期待我今天的表现了哦，",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaace862a9121697017247e324f31c8681c220a13fabca62b15224f73eea9837",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4950bfd1c157b486cdb4c890",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我还记得这种感觉。\r\n这种时候去赌一把的话，\r\n多半都是惨败啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a85a372c13659f3ec8ff90656fe5e5d4e82db7786cba47e54e700418d602716",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cfa0b55e17024aa14d7edd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉状态很糟啊……\r\n去那些老地方转两圈，\r\n往心里面加点柴火吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d160d07843b658a71422af8fe8a2cfccb34f2926af7a887bc94c137d13d23f6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a1d43c866d13a96b55c92bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赌局可不是越多越好啊。\r\n千篇一律的玩意儿我可敬谢不敏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a89f6c1d0269902813d2045d1fd7ec1f7cd1fba388a3c86ab8d56985552d033",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:433f30538fafddbda1e614d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这和之前那局挺像的啊。\r\n……哼，你还在留恋之前的胜负吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79cf8316d12306fcc0a8654a4ca41fcaabb95fe0b1c3ac73e5cbc96c1826328e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2b76ba7f241890f7fddd03a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "证明之时已经到来了。\r\n我们所做的一切究竟是场闹剧呢……\r\n还是让世人都目瞪口呆的大闹剧呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5904cc5ef5fb34aad18bace6d3bcd8fdec2ce8e1fa18cf86fc2d527b4aabe59f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ba40234e229b04415f21063",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢欣・热情・恐惧・焦躁……\r\n这些感觉充斥于心中……\r\n好了，开干吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec0c92c15d5bdd9e0de27b52dde3fab1975a33c6e8776a3f9d7b76cca1a42a48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5574cc6649c4bb1495e4d29d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用再多说什么了吧。\r\n接下来，就是燃烧你我二人生命\r\n的时刻了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02f17c57f1a46084090ed3e6f3aa334f28e9bbdc590987799f6f9506e7340e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73db8035c6bcf25398b46f99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……光是闻味道就明白了。\r\n今天的赛场正在熊熊燃烧——\r\n可算能来场激烈的对决啦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc6165d7229eeb8b847d830608a6c29825c98a220806063f1b6d6ac7427c494c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a14df47021486ef43e638e10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仿佛将内脏全部冻僵的寒冷、\r\n与腹中似乎要将一切燃尽的激情……\r\n今天是个放手一搏的好日子啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4de4c94ce9ceb4c98e25e7457f2c6e54fe5a78c7e214624bff1fd25bc8c822a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ffbdd998ee6831b44de8e22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以自己的双腿改变胜利的流向……\r\n如果是现在的我，也许能做到吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98caf9c97ce6ee9feff120ae9e1928e79922b4632027538686777ef5341a72f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2c923d9dd8d40715bde9134",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉天命今天不站我这边啊。\r\n不过……在比赛中把它拽过来就好了",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d54550fdd04df11c034dc486c15b8489f14ecde68b5f73700adf1dcbf175d8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a6dbe57ff4470aa05e475c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜负概率是五五开吗……\r\n这可的确算是足够让人汗毛倒竖\r\n的状况了呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "441f06516f666f0ebce88fdf6ace0de08aef041c5c4c5deee6f05b8cf600b5c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47946e08257d1cae5222fc61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经为胜利做好万全的准备了……\r\n不过把这些准备全都推翻\r\n来场放手一搏倒也不错啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c7d51b8ec70ed9a869e82dd46d295e7daac2b160fc51eaf2518fadffd23ee61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e13dabea38efffc56ec51c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来是场烂透的赌局啊。\r\n……真叫人兴奋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6267309a9168b639cc3d6334f3d5ac879f3e9bf697030c56a36593ab87cbf50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4baac484021a7862c38bba8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜负乃赌徒之常事，现在只有\r\n尽全力将手中的牌打好罢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fcce8c3bc5dd2ae962e386496a9c7d2ef0e00b197f8360736bbeaf86a1b3134",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d8e1f408f18d7971eb56965",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来状态一塌糊涂啊。但看着\r\n我这样的家伙能拼到何种地步，\r\n到也算是个不错的消遣……对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa56e30e5c5fb9b689a3713130d73b110e54c6465c03202420666a9a0b37bd8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ea9a2f35a12420fb3ad1fb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打从一开始几乎就是败局已定啊……\r\n但就是这种毫无胜算的战斗，\r\n才能让我热血沸腾……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d29e75a068378d2b2fccafece7d4494b9f9637d8a9a5ea7de41b6545ae6ec6b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b041ffe14396282fcaad5bff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便胜负的结果终将交由天命，但\r\n有时也能在战前便分清孰优孰劣……\r\n那，这次会如何呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f326b808b2e9e3c0b0ed480b0967145bb93da43eb0c9eba8dd254ddd0cda79c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20036"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
